sequenceDiagram
    participant User as 用户
    participant PackageList as PackageList.vue
    participant ViewToggle as PackageListViewToggle.vue
    participant PackageTable as PackageTable.vue
    participant PackageGrid as PackageGrid.vue
    participant API as softwareApi

    User->>PackageList: 打开软件包列表页面
    PackageList->>API: fetchView() 加载软件包数据
    API-->>PackageList: 返回 SoftwareListEntry[]

    alt 表格视图 (viewMode = 'table')
        PackageList->>PackageTable: 渲染表格
        PackageTable->>PackageTable: 使用 StandardizedTable 渲染列
    else 网格视图 (viewMode = 'grid')
        PackageList->>PackageGrid: 渲染网格
        PackageGrid->>PackageGrid: 渲染 PackageCard 卡片
    end

    User->>ViewToggle: 点击切换视图按钮
    ViewToggle->>PackageList: emit change (table/grid)
    PackageList->>PackageList: 更新 viewMode ref
    PackageList->>PackageList: 持久化到 settings.software_view_mode

    User->>PackageList: 点击列配置按钮
    PackageList->>ColumnConfigPopover: 打开列配置弹窗
    ColumnConfigPopover->>ColumnConfigPopover: 显示可勾选列列表
    User->>ColumnConfigPopover: 勾选/取消勾选列
    ColumnConfigPopover->>PackageList: emit column-change
    PackageList->>PackageList: 持久化到 settings.column_visibility_software
